{"id":"prepositions-0078","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 78","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Doctors say stress is a major cause ___ insomnia.","hint":"cause ___ sth","explanation":"the cause OF something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The region is famous ___ its cheese.","hint":"famous ___ sth","explanation":"famous FOR something."},{"answer":"at","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Everyone laughed ___ his impression of the headmaster.","hint":"laugh ___ sth","explanation":"laugh AT something/somebody."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s terrified ___ spiders.","hint":"terrified ___","explanation":"terrified OF something."},{"answer":"between","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"There\u0027s a direct connection ___ diet and mood.","hint":"connection ___ A and B","explanation":"a connection/link BETWEEN two things."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Police suspect him ___ faking the documents.","hint":"suspect sb ___ sth","explanation":"suspect somebody OF something/doing something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Have you paid ___ the tickets yet?","hint":"pay ___ sth (goods)","explanation":"pay FOR goods/services; pay a bill (no preposition)."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m sick ___ hearing that song on the radio.","hint":"sick ___ sth (annoyed)","explanation":"sick OF something = fed up with it."}]}